[ti:Day 09]

[00:00.00]hostile 例 As an extremely controversial public figure, she has shouldered much hostile criticism. 作 为一名极具争议的公众人物，她已经应对了许多 带有敌意的批评。
[00:13.30]communicator 例 A great communicator should be judged by how well they can convey certain concepts to people who need to know about them. 判断一 个人是不是个优秀的传播者，应该看他们能不能 把某些概念很好地传达给需要了解这些概念的 人。
[00:31.20]scrutiny 例 The manuscript has been passed to the general editor for more detailed scrutiny. 草音 频稿已送交主编作更详细的审查。
[00:43.39]dynamic 例 Asia continues to be one of the most dynamic economic regions in the world. 亚洲 仍然是全球经济最活跃的地区之一
[00:54.48]clutch 例 Stock can only be borrowed from a small clutch of brokers, a group not renowned for holding huge quantities of shares. 只有一小批 经纪人能够借出股票，而这些经纪人并不以持有 大量股票而著称。
[01:11.11]backlash 例 Investors have been enthusiastic buyers of commercial property across the world, partly as a backlash against the stock market crash of four years ago. 投资者一直是全球各地商用房 产的热情买家，部分是因为四年前的股市崩盘所 导致的对抗性反应。
[01:32.81]integrity 例 He questioned her integrity as a stockholder. 他质疑她作为股东的诚信度。
[01:40.57]fine 例 If a fine of $500 million is in fact imposed, it would be the largest such penalty in U.S. history. 如果真的要处以500万美元的罚款，那么 这将是美国历史上关于此类事件罚款金额最大的 一笔。
[01:54.03]buffer 例 I tacts as a buffer against harmful environmental change. 它可以作为缓冲物来对抗 有害的环境变化。
[02:02.90]assimilation 例 The assimilation of complex information systems is an organisational learning and knowledge barrier lowing process. 对复杂的信 息体系的吸收是一个有组织的学习和不断降低知 识壁垒的过程。
[02:20.95]fantastic 例 A great many new universities were set up at a fantastic rate in the 1980s. 在20世纪80年 代，许多新大学以不可思议的速度建立了起来。
[02:32.20]amalgamate 例 The company has decided to amalgamate with the parent firm. 这家子公司已决定和母公司 合并。
[02:41.86]renovate 例 Renovate the house and you can sell it at a profit. 把房子整修一下，卖掉之后你就能大赚一 笔。
[02:49.78]downshift 例 As with the other aspects of the economy, their level of sales represents a downshift from faster times. 和经济的其他方面一样，他们 的销量水平较此前经济增长迅速时期有所下滑。
[03:05.14]chairman 例 Glyn Ford is the chairman of the committee which produced the report. 格林•福特是撰写该 报告的那个委员会的主席。
[03:15.75]flounder 例 Spending in rich countries will flounder as long as households look to pay down the debts to buy expensive houses. 只要发达国家 的家庭还在忙于还清购买昂贵房产所借的债务， 那些国家的消费就会持续错乱。
[03:32.22]woe 例 We are both true friends and good partners that share weal and woe. 我们俩人是患难与共 的真朋友、好搭档。
[03:41.56]purview 例 He is reluctant to deal with the thing out of his purview. 他不愿处理这件超出他权限的事情。
[03:50.28]facilitate 例 The development will help facilitate this project by connecting these funds with local partners and institutions. 该项开发将把此类基 金与当地合作伙伴和机构连通起来，以促进项目 的实施。
[04:07.54]counterbalance 例 Each state and all the states collectively could counterbalance the central government's power. 每个州以及所有的州集合 起来就有能力平衡中央政府的权力。
[04:23.06]initiate 例 They will initiate a seminar on economics. 他们将开办一个经济学研讨班。
[04:30.19]jingle 例 He wrote a jingle for a shampoo advert. 他 为洗发水广告写了一则广告语。
[04:36.36]reproach 例 He is always reproached for carelessness. 由于粗心，他总是被责备。
[04:43.49]complicate 例 It would complicate the Fed's job of eventually shrinking its balance-sheet. 这将使 得美联储最终收缩其资产负债表的工作复杂化。
[04:55.69]catalyst 例 Leadership is the catalyst for transforming those talents into results. 领导才能是把智慧转 化成成果的催化剂。
[05:06.93]greenmail 例 The ABC company found themselves the victim of greenmail when they realised they had bought back their stock at a much higher price. 当ABC公司以高得多的价格买回自己的股 份时，发现自己成了绿票欺诈的受害者。
[05:25.94]diverse 例 The impacts of climate change on the whole world will be diverse. 气候变化对整个世 界的影响将是多样化的。
[05:35.75]across-the-board 例 The issues are too complex for across- theboard treatment. 这些问题太过复杂，难以处 理周全。
[05:46.37]alternative 例 Not only do they allow us to choose between alternative courses of action, they also work when a choice doesn't come with all the options up front. 它们不但可以让我们在两 条行动路线中作出选择，而且在我们无法作出决 定时也会有所帮助。
[06:07.43]equipment 例 All of the equipment has been loaded and will be shipped to the port of Shanghai. 所有设 备都将被装船运到上海港。
[06:19.47]converge 例 Training, knowledge management and communications will converge. 培训、知识管理 和沟通三者将逐渐融合到一起。
[06:30.08]pawn 例 Pawn shops serve a small and niche market, so you couldn't expect them to grow into a big industry. 典当行针对的是一个小众市 场，所以你不要奢望它能发展成为一个大的行 业。
[06:43.70]conspire 例 Those who plot and conspire will certainly come to no good end. 搞阴谋诡计的人绝不会有 好下场。
[06:53.36]illustrate 例 The best way to illustrate how to do something is to present counterexamples. 说明 如何做某事的最好方法是举反例。
[07:05.40]sluice 例 They sluice the pavement with a hose every day. 他们每天都用水龙带冲刷人行横道。
[07:12.68]horse-trading 例 The whole transaction process highlighted the institution's culture of horse-trading. 整个 交易过程凸显了那家机构讨价还价的文化。
[07:26.93]bog 例 A wrong decision made by the government may bog the economy down. 政府的错误决定可 能会使经济陷入困境。
[07:36.12]affected 例 Her affected smile is really painful to endure. 她那做作的笑容实在让人难以忍受。
[07:43.88]wastrel 例 The man, denounced by the neighbour as a wastrel, has dissipated his property. 那个被邻 居称为败家子的男人花光了他所有的财产。
[07:55.60]novelty 例 In recently years, as the novelty has worn off, China's consumption of western fast food is decreasing. 近年来，随着新奇感的消失，中国 在西式快餐上的消费正在下降。
[08:10.65]copious 例 We dedicated copious amounts of time and attention to our work to maintain our high personal standards. 我们在工作上花费了大量的 时间和精力，以维持自己的高标准。
[08:25.69]guardian 例 The court constituted him legal guardian of the child. 法庭指定他为这个孩子的合法监护人。
[08:34.40]focus 例 You should focus more on the future of the company and the industry. 你应该更多地关注公 司及行业的未来。
[08:44.22]abrogate 例 In the fall of 2012, Greece abrogated its bail-out agreement with the International Monetary Fund, European Union and European Central Bank. 2012 年秋，希腊废除了与国际货币 基金组织、欧盟以及欧洲中央银行签订的援助协 定。
[09:05.29]assurance 例 We have no assurance it will create jobs or revive the economy. 我们不能保证它将创造就业 机会或者重振经济。
[09:15.11]shelter 例 You can help by doing some volunteer work in a shelter or some other organisation that helps the homeless. 你可以通过在避难所或者其 他一些援助流浪者的机构里做些志愿者工作来帮 助他们。
[09:30.31]acculturate 例 It is not easy to acculturate the German immigrants into American society. 让那些德国 移民融入美国社会并不容易。
